  {
   "id": "sisyphus-light-shifts",
   "what": "lin⊥lin光中两个基态的光致频移",
   "source": "现代原子与光学物理 II，8.6.2 西西弗斯冷却",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "assumes": [
      {
       "tex": "\\kDelta^{\\sigma_+}_{1/2} = \\frac{|\\kOmegap|^2}{\\kdelta}",
       "src": "(8.99)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\kDelta^{\\sigma_+}_{-1/2} = \\frac{|\\kOmegap|^2}{3\\kdelta}",
       "src": "(8.100)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\kDelta^{\\sigma_-}_{1/2} = \\frac{|\\kOmegam|^2}{3\\kdelta}",
       "src": "(8.101)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\kDelta^{\\sigma_-}_{-1/2} = \\frac{|\\kOmegam|^2}{\\kdelta}",
       "src": "(8.102)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\kOmegap = \\kOmega\\cos \\kkmag z",
       "src": "(8.103)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\kOmegam = \\kOmega\\sin \\kkmag z",
       "src": "(8.104)"
      }
     ],
     "then": {
      "tex": "\\mk{H}{\\kH^\\mathrm{eff}_{AL}} = \\mk{R}{\\hbar\\sum_{m=\\pm\\frac{1}{2}}(\\kDelta^{\\sigma_+}_m + \\kDelta^{\\sigma_-}_m)|m\\rangle\\langle m|}",
      "src": "(8.105)",
      "uses": [],
      "why": "在远失谐情形下，两种偏振的光致频移相加。"
     },
     "steps": [
      {
       "tex": "\\begin{aligned}\\mk{H}{\\kH^\\mathrm{eff}_{AL}} &= \\mk{u}{\\hbar\\left(\\frac{|\\kOmegap|^2}{\\kdelta} + \\frac{|\\kOmegam|^2}{3\\kdelta}\\right)|\\tfrac{1}{2}\\rangle\\langle\\tfrac{1}{2}|} \\\\ &\\quad + \\mk{d}{\\hbar\\left(\\frac{|\\kOmegap|^2}{3\\kdelta} + \\frac{|\\kOmegam|^2}{\\kdelta}\\right)| -\\tfrac{1}{2}\\rangle\\langle -\\tfrac{1}{2}|}\\end{aligned}",
       "uses": [
        0,
        1,
        2,
        3
       ],
       "map": {
        "R": [
         "u",
         "d"
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\begin{aligned}\\mk{H}{\\kH^\\mathrm{eff}_{AL}} &= \\mk{u}{\\hbar\\frac{|\\kOmega|^2}{\\kdelta}\\left(\\cos^2 \\kkmag z + \\frac{1}{3}\\sin^2 \\kkmag z\\right)|\\tfrac{1}{2}\\rangle\\langle\\tfrac{1}{2}|} \\\\ &\\quad + \\mk{d}{\\hbar\\frac{|\\kOmega|^2}{\\kdelta}\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\cos^2 \\kkmag z + \\sin^2 \\kkmag z\\right)| -\\tfrac{1}{2}\\rangle\\langle -\\tfrac{1}{2}|}\\end{aligned}",
       "uses": [
        4,
        5
       ]
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\begin{aligned}\\mk{H}{\\kH^\\mathrm{eff}_{AL}} &= \\mk{u}{\\hbar\\frac{|\\kOmega|^2}{\\kdelta}\\left(1 - \\frac{2}{3}\\sin^2 \\kkmag z\\right)|\\tfrac{1}{2}\\rangle\\langle\\tfrac{1}{2}|} \\\\ &\\quad + \\mk{d}{\\hbar\\frac{|\\kOmega|^2}{\\kdelta}\\left(1 - \\frac{2}{3}\\cos^2 \\kkmag z\\right)| -\\tfrac{1}{2}\\rangle\\langle -\\tfrac{1}{2}|}\\end{aligned}",
       "uses": [],
       "cap": "$\\cos^2 kz + \\frac{1}{3}\\sin^2 kz = 1 - \\frac{2}{3}\\sin^2 kz$，$\\sin$与$\\cos$互换后同理。"
      }
     ],
     "num": "(8.106), (8.107)",
     "note": "书中印出的第二行，即式 (8.107)，没有把它与式 (8.106) 连接起来的加号：哈密顿量是两行之和。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
